-- Affine torsor triviality audit (W3, part A): SerreAffineTorsor only.
-- One owned module; 87 declarations. Every torsor under the associated
-- module of an A-module on Spec A merely has a global section, by principal
-- refinement of local sections, basic components of the difference cocycle,
-- the checked degree-one gluing and torsor correction gluing (empty cover
-- included). Audited openings are structural section/scalar carriers of the
-- associated sheaf, the Zariski lattice quotient carrier, cochain/family
-- types of the gluing data, cover overlaps and truncation carriers; no
-- construction proof (extend, restriction, gluing, vanishing) reopens.
